M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1 space-y-2"><p class="text-sm">Based on the employee handbook (Section 3.2), remote work is permitted for roles that do not require on-site presence. Employees must submit a remote work request form at least 2 weeks in advance<span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground"> [Source 1]</span>.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-success/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs text-success"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-success"></span>High Confidence (96%)</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="features" class="border-t py-20 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Enterprise-Grade RAG</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground">Everything you need to build production-ready RAG applications with automatic hallucination prevention.</p></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Self-Correcting Pipeline</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">An 8-node LangGraph workflow that evaluates confidence after every retrieval. Low-confidence results trigger automatic query rewriting and re-retrieval.</p></div><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-6 w-6"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Hybrid Retrieval</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Combines vector similarity search (Qdrant, 384d) with PostgreSQL full-text search (BM25) using Reciprocal Rank Fusion and cross-encoder reranking.</p></div><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Confidence Scoring</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Three-tier confidence system combining vector similarity (30%), reranker (50%), and coverage (20%). Maps to HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW tiers driving self-correction.</p></div><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-branch h-6 w-6"><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="3" y2="15"></line><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Contradiction Detection</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Identifies numerical and policy conflicts across retrieved chunks, preventing inconsistent answers by detecting conflicts before generation.</p></div><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text h-6 w-6"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Multi-Format Support</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Ingest PDF, PNG, and JPEG documents up to 50MB. Automatic OCR via Tesseract for scanned documents, semantic chunking, and section header detection.</p></div><div class="group rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4 transition-colors group-hover:bg-primary/20"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column h-6 w-6"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Full Observability</h3><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Every query is traced through the pipeline with per-node latencies, confidence breakdowns, token usage, and exportable reports in JSON, CSV, or Markdown.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Proven Performance</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground">Measured against a standard RAG baseline on an 18-question benchmark dataset covering factual, quantitative, and edge-case questions.</p></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl">94.7%</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Faithfulness</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl">70%</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Fewer Hallucinations</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl">86%</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Fewer Context Errors</div></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-5xl">18/18</div><div class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Failure Tests Passed</div></div></div></div></section><section id="workflow" class="border-t py-20 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Self-Correction Workflow</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground">An 8-node LangGraph state machine that automatically detects and corrects low-confidence results.</p></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="relative rounded-xl border bg-card p-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg></div><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono">01</span></div><h3 class="font-medium text-sm mb-1">Retrieve</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Hybrid search (Vector + BM25 + RRF + Cross-Encoder)</p></div><div class="relative rounded-xl border bg-card p-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 